  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Even at 1st level, the bad luck of the bumbler bleeds over into the lives of others. All enemies within 30 feet of the bumbler gain the effects of the bumbler’s jinxed life class feature.</p>\n<p>Enemies receive a Will save (DC 10 + 1/2 bumbler level + Wisdom modifier) to resist the effect when they enter the area. If a creature leaves and re-enters the area, they must make the save again. If an enemy fails a d20 roll while under the effects of aura of misfortune, the bumbler may activate a catastrophe, if they have uses remaining this round (see the catastrophe class feature). The creature that failed the d20 roll is treated as the point of origin of the effect for the catastrophe.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bumbler#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
